Package: stacklane
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Stacklane <hello@stacklane.io>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), adduser, systemd
Recommends: postgresql (>= 15), caddy
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://stacklane.io
Description: Customer panel for hosting companies
 Stacklane gives hosting customers one panel for game servers, VPS,
 domains, web hosting, support and billing. The package contains the
 server, the web panel and the website.
